{
  "id": 10000803725444,
  "title": "LiveIn 100% Latex Mattress",
  "handle": "duroflex-livein-100-latex-mattress",
  "body_html": "<p>Experience the perfect fusion of natural comfort and advanced support with the Duroflex LiveIn 100% Latex Mattress. Crafted with biodegradable natural latex and body-contouring memory foam, this mattress is designed to adapt to your body while ensuring a cool and breathable sleeping environment.<br>The 100% natural pincore latex layer provides exceptional support and pressure relief and promotes optimal spinal alignment. Additionally, its unique pincore structure enhances airflow and breathability, making it an ideal choice for hot sleepers. Paired with super soft foam, the mattress offers a plush, cloud-like feel, cradling your body in comfort while relieving pressure points for uninterrupted relaxation.<br>Designed for even weight distribution, the mattress minimizes strain on key pressure points like your back, hips, and shoulders, ensuring a pain-free sleep, no matter your sleeping position. Encased in premium breathable fabric, it wicks away moisture and feels silky-smooth against your skin, enhancing your overall sleep experience.<br>With a premium design and an emphasis on comfort, durability, and breathability, the Duroflex LiveIn 100% Latex Mattress redefines luxury sleep.</p>",
